        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>14\" Square Stainless Steel Glass Door Handles</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 14 inch stainless steel glass door handles feature an easy to grip 1-1/8 inch square pull handle that is very comfortable.  For use on glass shower doors, wine cellar glass doors or commercial glass doors such as store entry doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG443-335-speifications.gif?v=1704354619\" width=\"587\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Square Stainless Steel Glass Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--- <p>\r\nAlso available: Larger <a href=\"/products/2-foot-contemporary-glass-door-handles-pair-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>24\" Glass Door Handles</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/3-foot-contemporary-glass-door-handles-pair-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>36\" Glass Door Handles</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/4-foot-contemporary-glass-door-handles-pair-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>48\" Glass Door Handles</b></a>\r\n</p> --->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Square Stainless Glass Door Handles:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 14\" (355 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 6\" (152 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/16\" (81 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/8\" (29 mm) Square</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 door pulls and mounting hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
